## Exact validation messages

| Field | Messages |
|---|---|
| name | `Full name is required` \| `Name must be between 2 and 100 characters` |
| regNo | `Registration number is required` \| `Registration number may only contain letters, numbers, dashes and slashes` (3–30 chars) |
| title | `Assignment title is required` \| `Title must be between 3 and 150 characters` |
| url | `Submission URL is required` \| `Enter a valid URL starting with http:// or https://` |

## Required test names (exact)

- `test_complete_details_and_valid_url_is_saved_and_listed`
- `test_missing_registration_number_is_rejected_with_validation_message`
- `test_invalid_submission_url_is_rejected_and_not_saved`

## API contract

- `GET /api.php` → `200` `{ok, count, submissions}`
- `POST` valid → `201` `{ok: true, submission}`
- Invalid → `422` `{ok: false, message: "Validation failed", errors: {field: message}}`
- Bad JSON → `400`
- Over 16KB → `413`
- Other methods → `405` with `Allow` header

